#: menu/colours_menu.lua:331
msgid ""
"Applies to Nerd Font and FontAwesome icon glyphs (the Private Use Area "
"range, e.g. %W, %B, %k). Unicode symbols in the regular text ranges (like "
"the hourglass \"⌛\") follow the text color instead.\n"
"\n"
"An inline [c=#RRGGBB]…[/c] tag in a line overrides the icon colour for any "
"glyphs inside it."
msgstr "Platí pre glyfy ikon Nerd Font a FontAwesome (rozsah Private Use Area, napr. %W, %B, %k). Symboly Unicode v bežných textových rozsahoch (napríklad presýpacie hodiny \"⌛\") sa riadia farbou textu.\n\nZnačka [c=#RRGGBB]…[/c] vnútri riadku prepíše farbu ikon pre všetky glyfy, ktoré obsahuje."

